p("N008","Let 0<tau<=1, let u be a smooth real mean-zero exact KdV solution on [0,T], v=S_(-t)u, and M>=1+sup_[0,T]||v||_(H^gamma). On any step of the smooth twisted Scheme trajectory f_n, assume delta_n=||f_n-v(t_n)||_2<=1 and put q_n=tau^gamma+delta_n. For Interp, with constants C_M depending only on M,gamma,T, uniformly in n,tau and support: sup_(I_n)||F_n||_(H^1)<=C_M, sup_(I_n)||F_n-F_(t_n)(t;v(t_n))||_(H^1)<=C_M*delta_n; sup_(I_n)(||F_n||_(H^a_gamma)+||F_n||_2)<=C_M*q_n; ||z_n||_(X(I_n))<=C_M; sup_(I_n)||B_t(F_n,F_n)||_2<=C_M*q_n; sup_(I_n)||Q_n||_2+||W_n||_2<=C_M*tau*q_n; sup_(I_n)||Dinv B_t(f_n,F_n)||_2<=C_M*q_n; sup_(I_n)||Dinv Y_n||_2<=C_M*tau*q_n and sup_(I_n)||Dinv Y_n'||_2<=C_M*q_n; sup_(I_n)||Y_n||_2<=C_M*q_n, ||Y_n||_(X(I_n))<=C_M*q_n and sup_(I_n)||Y_n||_(H^(-pstar))<=C_M*tau*q_n. Here a_gamma=1/2-gamma if gamma<1/2, 1/8 if gamma=1/2, and 0 if gamma>1/2. No numerical H^gamma norm is used.",
