{id:"A002",input:"E004",at:"S002",bindings:"sigma as fixed under L1, epsilon=1/8 at sigma=1/2; choose a(sigma)=a_sigma and arbitrary f,g with the stated regularities.",hypothesis_checks:["L1 gives 0<sigma<=1; the piecewise choice agrees with the source and fixes the positive endpoint loss.","The asserted product estimate retains precisely its H^sigma and H^a_sigma input conditions."]},
