","value":"T"},{"path":"/inference/locals/4/objects/1","value":"L"},{"path":"/inference/locals/5/objects/0","value":"u0"},{"path":"/inference/locals/5/objects/1","value":"Pcut"},{"path":"/inference/locals/8","value":{"symbol":"U","type":"numerical trajectory","scope":"R012/argument","start":"S001","end":"S003","kind":"definition","declaration":"Let U be the Scheme trajectory from u0 at step tau.","from_inputs":[],"from_local":[],"objects":["Scheme","u0","tau"]}},{"path":"/inference/locals/9","value":{"symbol":"Um","type":"family of smooth numerical trajectories","scope":"R012/argument","start":"S002","end":"S003","kind":"definition","declaration":"For each m let Um be the Scheme trajectory from u0m at the same tau; U_m^n denotes its nth term.","from_inputs":[],"from_local":[],"objects":["Scheme","u0m","tau"]}},{"path":"/inference/locals/10","value":{"symbol":"Kflow","type":"L^2 flow comparison constant","scope":"R012/argument","start":"S001","end":"S001","kind":"witness","declaration":"Choose the constant in N001's two-flow comparison at initial norm sum bound 2*R.","from_inputs":["N001"],"from_local":[],"objects":["T","R"]}},{"path":"/inference/argument/0/text","value":"H001-H003 give the fixed admissible T,gamma,R. Choose common C,tau0>0 from N011, depending only on these three. Fix arbitrary u0,L and assume L1: u0 is real mean-zero in H^gamma, ||u0||_(H^gamma)<=R, L is a positive integer and tau=T/L<=tau0. Set u0m=P_(<=m)u0. Fourier truncation preserves reality and zero mean, gives ||u0m||_(H^gamma)<=R, and the tail of the convergent weighted square sum shows u0m->u0 in H^gamma and L^2. N001 supplies the exact rough solution u and smooth solutions um with a common H^gamma bound. Its two-flow estimate at B0=2R gives sup_[0,T]||um-u||_2<=Kflow||u0m-u0||_2->0."},{"path":"/inference/argument/0/objects/18","value":"U"},{"path":"/inference/argument/0/objects/19","value":"Kflow"},{"path":"/inference/argument/1/objects/18","value":"U"},{"path":"/inference/argument/1/objects/19","value":"Um"},{"path":"/inference/argument/2/objects/18","value":"U"},{"path":"/inference/argument/2/objects/19","value":"Um"}]}
